    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Eledrius... o seom vetheriondre di deluveum.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: This is Summit Glyph. This place emboldens my mind and spirit. I almost
        feel...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: ...no, not yet.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[3]'
      value: This node is unique. It is a <color=#FF8CAB>Terminal</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[4]'
      value: Judging by the potency of the Mountain spirit in this place, <color=#FF8CAB>Terminals</color>
        may have some special properties...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[5]'
      value: I sense more of them across the Mountain. If awakened, their secrets
        may be revealed to us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Is there... another being in this place? My perception is still limited.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: I am surprised any creatures still walk this land. Maybe there is hope
        after all...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1450705890743367129, guid: 837530b0a584744c595fd7a34d502621,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
